# SokoYetu Stage 37A: UX Cleanup, WhatsApp, Offer Rail and Manual M-PESA

This stage adds:

```text
Floating WhatsApp button
Right-side rotating offer rail on desktop
Cleaner checkout page
Home delivery and self-pickup selection
Manual M-PESA fallback while Daraja is pending
Customer-safe error wording
```

## Values used

```text
WhatsApp number: 254714565555
M-PESA Buy Goods Till: 6923522
```

If the WhatsApp number is wrong, update `WHATSAPP_NUMBER` inside `checkout.html` and `app.js`.

## Test

```cmd
npm run stage37a:check
node --check server.js
npm run dev
```

Manual test:

1. Open homepage.
2. Confirm WhatsApp button appears.
3. Confirm right offer rail appears on desktop.
4. Add product to cart.
5. Click checkout.
6. Confirm `/checkout.html` opens.
7. Confirm Home delivery and Self-pickup appear.
8. Submit a controlled order.
9. If Daraja fails, confirm manual M-PESA instructions appear without technical text.
